| Escape   | Meaning                                |
| -------- | -------------------------------------- |
| `\n`     | New line (moves to next line)          |
| `\t`     | Tab space                              |
| `\\`     | Backslash (`\`)                        |
| `\'`     | Single quote                           |
| `\"`     | Double quote                           |
| `\r`     | Carriage return (moves to beginning)   |
| `\b`     | Backspace (removes previous character) |
| `\uXXXX` | Unicode character                      |



